# Autonomous Binary Execution Engine

## Overview
The Autonomous Binary Execution Engine is engineered to operate natively within the local environment (`C:\J.A.I.S.S`). It executes industrial-grade binary intelligence tasks, local system refactoring, and secure script execution entirely on local hardware without reliance on external cloud APIs or third-party server infrastructure.

## Operational Workflow
1. **Local Ingestion:** Inputs and automation triggers are received through hardened PowerShell subsystem integration.
2. **Deterministic Processing:** Execution is handled via custom binary AI models governed by strict zero-drift assertion checks (`SAI-OS_HARDENED`).
3. **Session Management:** Context-aware persistence engines manage local memory state and automated directory tracking back to the core root architecture.
